    {
      "claim": "Simvastatin L6 hepatic-metabolism records (C292, C294, C326, C323, C286) and triptolide CYP3A metabolism records (C283, C291, C332) are not transferable as affirmative low-F evidence: simvastatin is a prodrug lactone with a hydrophobic decalin core and ester side chain, and triptolide lacks the tert-butyl trilactone cage; no direct F is supplied for triptolide, and its rat microsomal half-life (35.7 min) is moderate.",
      "card_ids": ["C292","C294","C326","C323","C286","C283","C291","C332"]
